Testing string startsWith method (bilow):

Basic example:
  magac = Barwaaqo
  magac.bilow(Bar) = run
  magac.bilow(waa) = been

More test cases:
  Hello.bilow(Hello) = run
  Hello World.bilow(hello) = been
  Hello World.bilow(Hello) = run

Empty string edge cases:
  Empty string.bilow(empty) = run
  Something.bilow(empty) = run
  Empty string.bilow(x) = been

Practical examples:
  URL protocol checking:
  https://example.com starts with https:// run
  http://example.org starts with https:// been
  ftp://files.net starts with ftp:// run

  Email username checking:
  user@example.com starts with user@ run
  admin@company.org starts with admin@ run

  Filename prefix checking:
  document.pdf starts with doc run
  image.jpg starts with img been

String startsWith tests completed!
